"//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10nut.jpg"}, {"id": 1710531, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10nur.jpg"}, {"id": 1710527, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10nun.jpg"}, {"id": 1710528, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10nuo.jpg"}, {"id": 1710529, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10nup.jpg"}, {"id": 1710532, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10nus.jpg"}, {"id": 1710534, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10nuu.jpg"}, {"id": 1710526, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10num.jpg"}], "slug": "incoherence-dark-rooms", "storyline": "You are Astrid Kepler. You awaken in a strange yet familiar room with multiple doors, with no recollection of how you arrived.\n\nAs you explore, you discover that this strange place you are trapped in is constructed from interconnected rooms drawn from your own memories, beginning with fragments of your childhood and gradually extending into the later years of your life.\n\nEvery door you open leads to a new, unpredictable space. You must explore, solve puzzles, and manage limited resources as the mysterious structure constantly evolves around you.\n\nBut you are not alone. Something else moves through the rooms with you, adapting to your progress and growing more dangerous the deeper you go.", "summary": "Dark Rooms is a survival horror room-drafting game set in a looping nightmare. Expand the map by placing rooms at the cost of stability. Fight monsters, solve puzzles, manage limited resources, and unlock new rooms and upgrades. Every run is a new descent into darkness.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/incoherence-dark-rooms"}